    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">All
    of the shares of common stock being offered under this prospectus are being sold by the selling stockholder. Accordingly, we will
    not receive any proceeds from the sale of these shares.</FONT></TD></TR>
